{"sourceUrl":"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0629/c6444a320694/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.887133+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0629/c6444a320694/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span></span></p><p><span><span>为促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，合肥工业大学外国语学院拟举办</span><span>“</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”活动，诚挚邀请广大学子踊跃参加。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营活动参与专业包括<span>外国语言文学（0502）、</span>英语笔译（</span><span>055101专业学位），各专业招收名额视报名情况决定。申请工作自本通知发布当日开始。</span></span></p><p><span>  一、申请资格</span></p><p><span> （一）具有研究生推免资格高校的大学本科三年级在校生（</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>届本科毕业生）；</span></p><p><span> （二）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span> （三）学习成绩优异</span><span>，</span><span>有浓厚科研兴趣</span><span>，</span><span>有较强的研究能力；</span></p><p><span> （四）有望取得就读学校推荐免试研究生资格。</span></p><p><span>  二、申请方式及申请时间</span></p><p><span> （一）申请方式</span></p><p><span>  申请人应以邮件方式报名，申请材料发送至邮箱。</span></p><p><span>1.<span>外国语言文学（0502）：申请材料发送至：</span><span>791294113@qq.com</span><span>，邮件主题：“拟报考学科方向+姓</span><span>名+学校”。（例：英语语言文学+</span><span>张三</span><span>+xx大学）。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>英语笔译（055101专业学位）：申请材料发送至：</span><span>31845116@qq.com</span><span>，邮件主题：“拟报考学科方向+姓名+学校”。（例：</span><span>英语笔译</span><span>+张</span><span>三</span><span>+xx大学）。</span></span></p><p><span>3.凡申请参加夏令营活动的学生需在邮件中提供以下材料的扫描件（请以压缩包方式打包发送）：</span></p><p><span><span> （</span><span>1）外国语学院</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表（附件</span><span>1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span><span>2）外国语学院</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请汇总表（附件</span><span>2）；</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span><span>3）本科前两年半成绩单及成绩排名证明（加盖学校教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span><span>4）身份证、学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span><span>5）其他附件材料，包括英语水平证明、获奖证明、参与社会实践项目证明、科研项目证明、发表的学术论文等能体现自身能力相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span> （二）申请时间</span></p><p><span>  自通知发布之日起至</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>12</span><span>:00。</span></p><p><span>  三、材料审核及营员选拔</span></p><p><span>夏令营营员选拔</span><span>由夏令营评审工作小组负责，</span><span>选拔</span><span>工作将于</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日前结束。夏令营营员入选名单及详细安排将在合肥工业大学外国语学院网站上公布，</span><span>不在名单上的</span><span>皆为未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p><p><span>  四、日程安排</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span>10</span><span>日。线上进行，具体活动安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span>  五、其他说明</span></p><p><span> 本活动解释权归</span><span>外国语学</span><span>院</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>  六、咨询电话</span></p><p><span>0551-63831091 </span><span><span>杜老师  <span>徐老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/1e/73/05daac754a26ab512d5cf938cec7/390ac112-0680-4238-9fd0-211c4b59b46b.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营申请表.docx</a></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/1e/73/05daac754a26ab512d5cf938cec7/390ac112-0680-4238-9fd0-211c4b59b46b.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif\"/></a><a href=\"https://wgyxy.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/1e/73/05daac754a26ab512d5cf938cec7/35ec8c67-4978-4614-9f2a-0c49016309e5.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营申请汇总表.xlsx</a></span></span><span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>外国语学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2026年6月29日</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span></span></span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span></span><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"2099cd7314717263f158c92be49211f2407a8d51f26f8c4a30b04a2b104c6754","textLength":973,"sourceSha256":"53ba3f656e8e8416cb05de138901542ecf5209e5478a691fa69fce5a2f9ef529","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c82369285990b8b44b0a","title":"2026年合肥工业大学外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.887133+00:00"}
